    "en": {
      "trackName": "Watch 15 Puzzle",
      "description": "The board has 15 square tiles numbered 1 to 15 in a frame that is 4 tile positions high and 4 tile positions wide, with one unoccupied position. Tiles in the same row or column of the open position can be moved by sliding them horizontally or vertically, respectively. The goal of the puzzle is to place the tiles in numerical order (from left to right, top to bottom).\n\nTry to win as fast as possible, playing on Apple Watch or iPhone!",
      "releaseNotes": "Bug fixes and performance improvements",
